    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27151" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διοικ-ητής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>administrator, governor,</i>
			
